# Assessment data.
# Nothing containing a real organisation's assessment answers or evidence belongs
# in this repository. A completed self-assessment is a map of where an organisation
# is weakest, which makes it one of the more sensitive documents it owns. Example
# fixtures used by the tests live under examples/ and are deliberately fictional.
assessments/
*.assessment.json
reports/
